#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Generate the ipplan statistics page: one self-contained HTML5 file
from a compiled ipplan.db, published on the doc server next to the db
it describes (it is /ipplan/'s index.html). The post-commit publisher runs this
after every publish (the postpub slot - prod's dhmap-style downstream
regeneration), so the page always shows the just-published revision.

No dependencies beyond the stdlib and no external assets: the doc
server serves it as-is behind the directory login.

Usage: ipplan-stats <ipplan.db> [<out.html>] [--diff-dir=DIR]
       (out.html defaults to stdout; --diff-dir adds the recent
        change reports, the ipplan-r<rev>.diff files)
"""

